        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "问题现象"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "在 Mac 根目录（/）下创建文件夹时出现报错："
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": null,
        "meta": null,
        "value": "Read-only file system"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "配图内容描述（原图为终端报错截图）：在终端执行 mkdir（或 touch）类命令创建根目录下的文件夹/文件时，系统返回 mkdir: ... Read-only file system 错误——这是 macOS 自 Catalina（10.15）起 对系统卷（System Volume）的只读保护机制，根目录默认不可写。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 3,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "解决方案"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "解决方案"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "执行以下命令以读写方式重新挂载根目录："
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "bash",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "sudo mount -uw /"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "执行后需输入管理员密码，然后即可在根目录创建文件/文件夹。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 3,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "补充说明"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "补充说明"
        }
